# Loki Cafe Stock Inventory System

A simple console-based cafe inventory stock system written in Python.
It supports Admin and Staff modes with menu, Register New Staff Account, View All Stocks Levels, Add New Ingredients and others

-----

# Feature

# Main Menu
- Login
- Exit System

# Admin Menu
- View All Stock Levels
- View Delivery Records Table)
- Add New Ingredient
- Stock Adjustment
- Remove Ingredient
- Record Incoming Delivery
- Filter Stock Alert
- View Shift Handover Reports
- Register New Staff Account
- Logout

# Staff Menu
- View All Stock Levels
- View Delivery Records Table)
- Deduct Stock Usage
- Record Incoming Delivery
- Filter Stock Alerts
- Log Shift Handover Report
- Logout

----

